('jq-0322-1','math','初中',11,'jkp-0322','single_choice',0.55,'一元二次方程 ax²+bx+c=0 中 a 必须满足？','[{"key": "A", "text": "a ≠ 0"}, {"key": "B", "text": "a = 0"}, {"key": "C", "text": "a > 0"}, {"key": "D", "text": "a < 0"}]','A','a≠0（否则不是二次）','template-j','approved','通用');
